sage board UI\\n    ├── vite.config.js    # Proxy /api to backend\\n    └── src/\\n        └── main.js       # Frontend logic (fetch, SSE, post)\\n```\\n\\n**Key Features Implemented:**\\n1. **Backend (server/index.js):**\\n   - Express server with CORS and JSON parsing\\n   - Embedded PGLite with filesystem persistence (`pglite-data/`)\\n   - Auto-creates `messages` table (id, text, created_at) on startup\\n   - `GET /api/messages` - fetch all historical messages\\n   - `POST /api/messages` - insert new message and broadcast via SSE\\n   - `GET /api/stream` - SSE endpoint for real-time updates\\n\\n2. **Frontend (client/):**\\n   - Clean, modern UI with message list and input form\\n   - Fetches initial messages on page load\\n   - Connects to SSE stream using `EventSource`\\n   - Appends real-time messages with fade-in animation\\n   - Form submission posts via HTTP and clears input\\n   - Connection status indicator (Live/Disconnected)\\n\\n**To run:** `npm install` then `npm run dev` (starts both servers concurrently)\"}"}}]}
